  "description": "Stunts is a modern interception library which implements the proxy pattern and runs everywhere, even where run-time code generation (Reflection.Emit) is forbidden or limitted, like physical iOS devices and game consoles, through compile-time code generation. The proxy behavior is configured in code using what we call a behavior pipeline.\n\n      ICalculator calculator = Stunt         .For<ICalculator>()         .AddBehavior((invocation, next) => ..., appliesTo: invocation => ...)         .ToObject();",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
